    - committed=true, id matches neither → {ok:false, code:"EVENT_ID_MISMATCH"}.
    - committed=false with matching current id → {ok:true, next_state:"SETTLEMENT", code:""} (keep retry).
    - committed=false with stale/foreign id → mismatch code.
