- pause(reason: String) -> {ok}: any active state → PAUSED. "Any active state → PAUSED": active = CASTING/WAITING/HOOKED/REELING/SETTLEMENT. From IDLE? IDLE is not active — pause from IDLE: harmless; but whitelist says "any active state → PAUSED". From IDLE → reject with BAD_TRANSITION? Hmm. IDLE pause = pointless but not unsafe. Whitelist is "any active state → PAUSED, others uniformly BAD_TRANSITION". IDLE isn't in active list → reject with BAD_TRANSITION. Double-pause → BAD_TRANSITION. Record reason.
