F11 spec: "single tick of 120 s from WAITING origin → exactly one HOOKED". From origin: cast, tick(1.0) → WAITING (carry 0), tick(120) → exactly one HOOKED, carry 120-w ∈ [60,100]. Then tick(0.5) → REELING 1 event; tick(0.5) → SETTLEMENT 1; tick(0.5) → 0 events. ✓

