Also in _simulate, initial cast at t=0: cast event not included in timeline — fine.

Timeline entries include the WAITING→HOOKED T entry with at_clock — logical time (boundary - carry) — exact integer across runs ✓. CASTING→WAITING at_clock: cast at T_c with stage 0, crossing at T_c+1 exactly? tick(step): stage += step; ≥1 → at_clock = boundary - carry = T_c +1 exactly? For 2.0: boundary T_c+2, carry 1 → T_c+1 ✓.

REELING→SETTLEMENT at_clock = HOOKED_time+2 ✓ exact.

HOOED at_clock = WAITING_entry_time + wait, WAITING_entry = T_c + 1 → exact integer ✓.

